      "content": "idk i dont really have time to go to the doctor right now work is crazy and insurance is such a pain. honestly the stretching sounds like something that would help loosen it up? like if i just do some deep yoga stretches or intense hamstring pulls maybe it will release the nerve or whatever. can't i just try some aggressive stretching at home first before i commit to a doctor visit?",
